# Base URL of the proxy API (empty = relative path, e.g. same origin behind nginx).
# Web (lex.2-way.ru): leave empty or set the proxy origin.
# Android (Capacitor) / Desktop (Tauri): set the full proxy URL,
# e.g. https://lex.2-way.ru
VITE_PROXY_URL=
# Shared secret for the X-App-Token header. Must match one of the tokens
# in the proxy's APP_TOKENS env var. Leave empty for local dev (proxy
# token checking is disabled when APP_TOKENS is unset).
VITE_APP_TOKEN=
